cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  如果你在研究中使用了 FluoFigFactory，请引用本项目。
  If you use FluoFigFactory in your research, please cite this software.
title: FluoFigFactory
authors:
  - alias: lovest117
    website: 'https://github.com/lovest117'
version: 1.4.6
date-released: '2026-09-18'
license: MIT
repository-code: 'https://github.com/lovest117/FluoFigFactory'
abstract: >-
  FluoFigFactory is a free, open-source tool for composing multi-channel
  fluorescence microscopy images into publication-ready figures. It supports
  TIFF import (including Olympus FV3000 LZW), channel management, scale bars,
  ROI/insets, line profiles and Pearson colocalization, and exports structured
  SVG/PDF where the base image, scale bar, ROI, inset and panel labels remain
  separately editable objects.
keywords:
  - fluorescence-microscopy
  - microscopy
  - scientific-figures
  - image-processing
  - tiff
